  "title": "Artivion to Participate in the 2026 Truist Securities MedTech Conference",
  "summary": "ATLANTA, June 10, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Artivion, Inc. (NYSE: AORT), a leading cardiac and vascular surgery company focused on aortic disease, announced today that it will participate at the upcoming 2026 Truist Securities MedTech Conference on Tuesday, June 16, 2026, at the Boston Harbor Hotel.",
